v></div><h3 class="text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl tracking-tight text-foreground">闪电般快速的生成</h3><p class="text-lg text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed">Raphael AI 图像生成器采用先进的图像生成引擎，以出色速度创建专业级图像。非常适合快速原型设计和创意工作流程，它能在几秒钟内生成令人惊艳的视觉效果，同时保持卓越质量。</p><div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-start"><a class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--ui-radius-control)] text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform] duration-150 ease-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--ui-disabled-opacity)] disabled:shadow-none active:translate-y-px [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-transparent bg-[var(--ui-button-primary-bg)] text-[var(--ui-button-primary-fg)] shadow-[var(--ui-shadow-button)] hover:bg-[var(--ui-button-primary-bg-hover)] hover:shadow-[var(--ui-shadow-button-hover)] h-10 px-4 py-2" href="/zh">Try Raphael AI</a></div></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg border shadow-lg"><img alt="生成的 AI 艺术作品展示" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimgs%2Ffeature108-1-v2.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimgs%2Ffeature108-1-v2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimgs%2Ffeature108-1-v2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_13inqbuimaivb_-trigger-tab-2" hidden="" id="radix-_R_13inqbuimaivb_-content-tab-2" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 mt-8 focus-visible:outline-none"></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_13inqbuimaivb_-trigger-tab-3" hidden="" id="radix-_R_13inqbuimaivb_-content-tab-3" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 mt-8 focus-visible:outline-none"></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-background my-20 relative render-when-visible"><div class="container z-10 mx-auto"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center"><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="border border-border/60 py-1.5 px-5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground/80 bg-background/50 backdrop-blur-sm">用户评价</div></div><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-6 text-foreground">用户对 Raphael AI 的评价</h2><p class="text-lg mt-6 text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed">看看创作者如何使用 Raphael AI 和 AI Image Editor 提高生产力</p></div><div class="flex justify-center gap-6 mt-10 [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,transparent,black_25%,black_75%,transparent)] max-h-[740px] overflow-hidden"><div class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 pb-6 bg-background animate-scroll" style="animation-duration:15s"><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>Raphael AI 图像生成器将我的创作效率提高了 10 倍！图像质量超乎想象，完全满足商业要求。</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Sophie Miller" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsophie-miller.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsophie-miller.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsophie-miller.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Sophie Miller</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">自由职业设计师</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>借助 AI Image Editor 功能，我可以精确控制每一个细节。Raphael AI 是市场上最强大的 AI 图像生成器！</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Michael Chen" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fmichael-chen.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fmichael-chen.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fmichael-chen.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Michael Chen</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">创意总监</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>作为一名电子商务经理，Raphael AI 图像生成器帮助我快速生成产品展示图片，生成效果比其他 AI 工具好得多！</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Sarah Wang" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsarah-wang.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsarah-wang.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsarah-wang.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Sarah Wang</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">电子商务经理</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>Raphael AI 图像生成器将我的创作效率提高了 10 倍！图像质量超乎想象，完全满足商业要求。</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Sophie Miller" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsophie-miller.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsophie-miller.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsophie-miller.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Sophie Miller</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">自由职业设计师</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>借助 AI Image Editor 功能，我可以精确控制每一个细节。Raphael AI 是市场上最强大的 AI 图像生成器！</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Michael Chen" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fmichael-chen.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fmichael-chen.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fmichael-chen.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Michael Chen</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">创意总监</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>作为一名电子商务经理，Raphael AI 图像生成器帮助我快速生成产品展示图片，生成效果比其他 AI 工具好得多！</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Sarah Wang" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsarah-wang.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsarah-wang.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fsarah-wang.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Sarah Wang</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">电子商务经理</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hidden md:block"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 pb-6 bg-background animate-scroll" style="animation-duration:19s"><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>AI Image Editor 让我能够保持品牌风格的一致性。Raphael AI 图像生成器真正理解我的需求。</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="David Liu" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fdavid-liu.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fdavid-liu.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fdavid-liu.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">David Liu</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">品牌设计师</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>Raphael AI 图像生成器的速度令人惊叹！几秒钟内生成专业质量的图像，大大缩短了项目周期。</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Emma Zhang" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Femma-zhang.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Femma-zhang.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Femma-zhang.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Emma Zhang</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">内容创作者</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>它的细节表现无与伦比。作为一名游戏开发者，Raphael AI 图像生成器已成为我们概念设计的首选工具。</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Kevin Wu" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fkevin-wu.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fkevin-wu.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fkevin-wu.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Kevin Wu</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">游戏概念艺术家</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-