ass="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Kevin Wu</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">游戏概念艺术家</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hidden lg:block"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 pb-6 bg-background animate-scroll" style="animation-duration:17s"><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>我尝试了很多工具，但 Raphael AI 图像生成器及其 AI Image Editor 功能确实改变了游戏规则！</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Jessica Li" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fjessica-li.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fjessica-li.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fjessica-li.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Jessica Li</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">数字营销专家</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>Raphael AI 图像生成器让广告创意落地变得非常简单。它生成的图像达到了商业摄影标准。</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Tom Anderson" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Ftom-anderson.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Ftom-anderson.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Ftom-anderson.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Tom Anderson</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">广告创意总监</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>作为一名独立开发者，Raphael AI 的 API 集成非常友好。它是市场上最好的 AI 图像生成器解决方案！</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Nina Patel" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fnina-patel.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fnina-patel.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fnina-patel.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Nina Patel</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">全栈开发人员</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>我尝试了很多工具，但 Raphael AI 图像生成器及其 AI Image Editor 功能确实改变了游戏规则！</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Jessica Li" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fjessica-li.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fjessica-li.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fjessica-li.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Jessica Li</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">数字营销专家</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>Raphael AI 图像生成器让广告创意落地变得非常简单。它生成的图像达到了商业摄影标准。</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Tom Anderson" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Ftom-anderson.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Ftom-anderson.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Ftom-anderson.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Tom Anderson</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">广告创意总监</div></div></div></div><div class="p-10 rounded-3xl border shadow-lg shadow-primary/10 max-w-xs w-full"><div>作为一名独立开发者，Raphael AI 的 API 集成非常友好。它是市场上最好的 AI 图像生成器解决方案！</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-5"><img alt="Nina Patel" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fnina-patel.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fnina-patel.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftestimonials%2Fnina-patel.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-medium tracking-tight leading-5">Nina Patel</div><div class="leading-5 opacity-60 tracking-tight">全栈开发人员</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-20"><div class="container px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div id="plans" class="mx-auto mb-12 text-center scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-semibold lg:text-4xl">选择您的套餐</h2><p class="text-muted-foreground lg:text-lg">免费图像包含水印。升级以获得干净的输出、更快的生成和商业用途。</p></div><div><div class="mx-auto grid min-h-[920px] max-w-[1180px] gap-4 md:min-h-[560px] md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-xl border border-border/40 bg-card/35 p-5"><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">专业版</h3><a href="/zh/pricing" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-medium text-primary">升级到专业版</a></article><article class="rounded-xl border border-border/40 bg-card/35 p-5"><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">旗舰版</h3><a href="/zh/pricing" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-medium text-primary">升级到旗舰版</a></article><article class="rounded-xl border border-border/40 bg-card/35 p-5"><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">至尊版</h3><a href="/zh/pricing" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-medium text-primary">升级到至尊版</a></article></div></div></div></section><section id="常见问题" class="py-16 render-when-visible"><div class="container"><div class="text-center"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 text-xs font-medium">常见问题</div><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight">常见问题</h2><p class="mt-6 text-base font-medium text-foreground/70">还有其他问题吗？请通过 <span>support@raphael.app</span> 联系我们</p></div><div class="mx-auto mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12"><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">1</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">什么是 Raphael AI 及其工作原理？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">Raphael AI 图像生成器是一款完全免费的 AI 图像生成器，内置智能多模型路由系统。您无需注册，也没有生成次数限制，只需输入文字描述即可生成高质量图像。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">2</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Raphael AI 真的免费使用吗？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">是的，Raphael AI 图像生成器完全免费使用！我们致力于成为世界上最大、最强大的免费 AI 图像生成器。没有隐藏费用、无需信用卡，也没有生成次数限制。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">3</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Raphael AI 与其他 AI 图像生成器有何不同？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">Raphael AI 图像生成器提供无生成次数限制的免费多模型智能路由能力。我们提供卓越的图像质量、快速的生成速度和完整的隐私保护，且无需任何费用或注册要求。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">4</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">我需要创建账户才能使用 Raphael AI 吗？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">无需账户——Raphael AI 图像生成器允许您访问 raphael.app 并立即开始生成图像。我们相信让每个人都能无障碍地使用人工智能。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">5</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">我可以使用 Raphael AI 创建哪些类型的图像？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">Raphael AI 图像生成器允许您创建各种图像，包括逼真的场景、艺术插图、数字艺术、动漫风格图像等。我们的智能路由器会为每个提示选择最佳模型，以处理复杂的指令并提供多样化的视觉风格。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">6</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Raphael AI 如何保护我的隐私？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">我们采用最小化数据收集原则：未登录用户的请求通常仅作临时处理；登录后仅保存提供账户、历史记录、订阅和安全能力所必需的信息。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">7</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">使用 Raphael AI 有什么限制吗？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">虽然 Raphael AI 是免费的，且没有生成次数限制，但我们维护标准的内容准则以确保适当使用。该平台目前专为网络使用而设计，计划在未来推出移动应用程序。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">8</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">我可以使用生成的图像进行商业用途吗？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">是的，您拥有使用 Raphael AI 生成的图像的权利。您可以将它们用于个人和商业目的，使其成为创作者和企业的理想选择。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">9</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Raphael AI 是否支持移动设备？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">目前，您可以通过我们的网站 raphael.app 访问 Raphael AI，该网站在移动浏览器上运行良好。我们正在积极开发专用的移动应用程序，以便尽快提供更好的体验。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">10</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">我如何提供反馈或报告问题？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">我们欢迎您的反馈！您可以通过 <span>support@raphael.app</span> 联系我们的支持团队。您的意见有助于我们改进和维护最好的免费 AI 图像生成服务。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">11</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Raphael AI 都支持哪些模型？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">Raphael AI 支持以下图片和视频模型。 图片模型: Nano Banana 2 Lite, Nano Banana, Nano Banana Pro, Nano Banana 2, GPT Image 2, Seedream 5.0 Lite, Seedream 5.0 Pro, Seedream 4.5, Seedream 4.0, Seedream 3.5 Pro. 视频模型: Seedance 2.0, Seedance 2.0 Mini, Seedance 1.5 Pro, Seedance 1.0 Pro Fast, Veo 3.1, Kling 3.0, Kling 3.0 Turbo, Seedance 1.0 Turbo.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">12</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">什么是免费的 AI 图像生成器？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">免费的 AI 图像生成器是一种把文字提示词转换成图片且不收取费用的工具。Raphael AI 让你直接在浏览器中生成图片，无需注册，也无需信用卡。更重要的是，登录用户在 Basic 模式（不含 Fast Mode）下可以真正无限免费生成，只需短暂排队。你也可以使用每日免费 credits 跳过队列，或解锁更高分辨率的模型。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">13</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">AI 如何根据文字生成图片？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">你输入一段描述，也就是提示词，AI 模型会理解其中的词语、对象、风格和构图要求，并渲染出匹配的图像。Raphael AI 会把提示词路由到 Seedream 3.5、Seedream、Nano Banana 等模型，并在几秒内返回结果。提示词越具体，结果越接近你的想法。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">14</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">使用 AI 生成图片合法吗？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">是的，在大多数国家和地区，使用 AI 生成图片是合法的。使用 Raphael AI 时，你拥有自己创建图片的权利，并可以用于个人项目。商业用途适用于付费套餐，并受我们的服务条款和适用法律约束。具体使用场景仍建议检查当地法规。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">15</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Raphael AI 安全并保护隐私吗？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">是的。我们采用最小化数据收集原则：未登录用户的请求通常只会临时处理，不会保存到历史记录，除非在 10 分钟内登录保存结果。登录用户只保留账户、历史记录和安全所必需的数据。我们不会出售你的提示词或图片。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">16</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">我可以将 AI 生成图片用于商业用途吗？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">付费套餐用户可以根据我们的服务条款和适用法律，将生成图片用于商业用途。免费用户可以将图片用于个人和其他非商业用途。你保留对自己生成图片的所有权。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">17</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">最好的免费 AI 图像生成器是什么？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">最好的免费 AI 图像生成器应同时具备图像质量、速度和无付费墙门槛。Raphael AI 是一个真正免费的选择：Seedream 3.5 模型消耗 0 credits，开始使用无需注册；登录后，Basic 模式（不含 Fast Mode）提供无限免费生成。每日免费 credits 和付费套餐可帮助你跳过队列，并使用 Seedream、Nano Banana 等模型获得更清晰的结果。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">18</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">什么是无门槛 AI 图像生成器？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">无门槛 AI 图像生成器会从基础体验中移除强制注册、信用卡和生成次数限制等障碍。使用 Raphael AI，你可以直接在浏览器开始生成，无需账户，也无需信用卡。登录后，Basic 模式（不含 Fast Mode）提供无限免费生成；如果想跳过队列或使用更高分辨率模型，可以使用每日 credits 或付费套餐。我们仍会执行标准内容规范，确保安全和合法使用。</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-primary font-mono text-xs text-primary">19</span><div><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">“无门槛”是否意味着图像质量更低？</h3></div><p class="text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed">不是。更少的使用障碍并不代表输出质量更弱。Raphael AI 的免费 Basic 模型生成速度很快，登录用户还可以切换到 Seedream 4.5/5.0（最高 2K）和 Nano Banana Pro 等更高分辨率模型，以获得更丰富的细节。你可以根据任务选择免费或付费模型。</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><section id="页脚" class="py-16 render-when-visible"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8"><footer><div class="flex flex-col items-center lg:items-start justify-between gap-10 text-center lg:flex-row lg:text-left"><div class="flex max-w-96 shrink flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 lg:items-start"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 lg:justify-start"><img src="/logo.webp" alt="Raphael AI" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchPriority="low" class="h-11"/><p class="text-3xl font-semibold">Raphael AI</p></div><p class="mt-6 text-md text-muted-foreground">Raphael AI 图像生成器：免费无限的 AI 图像生成器，聚合 Nano Banana 2 / Pro、Qwen-Image 和 Seedream 5.0 等顶尖模型。无需注册，无次数限制。</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-x-12 lg:gap-y-0 lg:ml-auto"><div class="text-center lg:text-left"><div class="mb-6 font-bold">关于</div><ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh#feature"><span>功能</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/pricing"><span>定价</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/partners"><span>合作伙伴</span></a></li></ul></div><div class="text-center lg:text-left"><div class="mb-6 font-bold">工具</div><ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/ai-image-editor"><span>AI 图像编辑器</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/uncrop"><span>扩展图像</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/background-remover"><span>移除背景</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a data-footer-image-tool="remove-watermark" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/remove-watermark"><span>AI 去水印</span><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-0.5"><span class="inline-flex h-[17px] shrink-0 items-center rounded-[4px] px-[5px] text-[8px] font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.04em] shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)] bg-primary/20 text-primary">NEW</span></span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/text-to-image"><span>文生图</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/image-to-image"><span>图生图</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/image-templates"><span>图片模板</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/text-to-video"><span>文生视频</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/image-to-video"><span>图生视频</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/app/video/video-upscaler"><span>视频放大</span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="https://fameo.ai"><span>AI 对口型视频</span></a></li></ul></div><div class="text-center lg:text-left"><div class="mb-6 font-bold">AI Models</div><ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/gemini-omni"><img src="/images/logos/video-models/gemini-omni-flash-aurora.svg" alt="Gemini Omni Flash icon" width="16" height="16" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchPriority="low" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 object-contain"/><span>Gemini Omni Flash</span><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-0.5"><span class="inline-flex h-[17px] shrink-0 items-center rounded-[4px] px-[5px] text-[8px] font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.04em] shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.10)] bg-primary/20 text-primary">NEW</span></span></a></li><li class="font-medium hover:text-primary"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/zh/seedance-2-5"><img src="/images/logos/video-models/seedance.svg" alt="Seedance 2.5 icon" width="16" height="16" loadi